<title>JAPAN: Japan could intervene before G7 -- Sakakibara quoted.</title>
<headline>Japan could intervene before G7 -- Sakakibara quoted.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Senior Finance Ministry official Eisuke Sakakibara has told one of Japan's major banks that Japanese monetary authorities are ready to intervene if the dollar rises relentlessly before next month's G7 meeting, banking sources said on Friday.</p>
</text>
